	"Description": "[b][size=5]STARDEW VILLAIN SELF-SAVING SYSTEM V1\n<br />[/size][/b][size=3]❗❗ [/size][size=4]I allow for this mod to receive a unofficial update for 1.6 as long as you make only the modified files available for download\u00A0❗❗[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4]❄️\uD83D\uDC39\u00A0[/size][b]INSTRUCTIONS\u00A0[/b][size=4]\uD83D\uDC39❄️[/size]\n<br />\n<br />༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶\n<br />\n<br />[size=3]\uD83C\uDF3B[/size][size=4]\u00A0To make this mod work you MUST download\u00A0[url=https://smapi.io/]SMAPI\u00A0[/url]+\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915]Content Patcher\u00A0[/url]+\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1820]TMXL[/url]\u00A0+\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/10971]HD Portraits[/url]\u00A0+\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5371]Anti-Social NPCs[/url]\u00A0+\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/10021]Free Love[/url]\n<br />[/size]\n<br />[size=3]1- Installing\u00A0\u00A0[b]SMAPI\uFEFF[/b]\u00A0creates the \"Mods\" folder.\n<br />\n<br />2- Place inside the new \"Mods\" folder:[b]\u00A0Content Patcher[/b]\u00A0+\u00A0[b]TMXL\uFEFF\u00A0[/b]+[b]HD Portraits[/b].\n<br />\n<br />[b][url=https://emojiterra.com/tulip/]\uD83C\uDF3B[/url]\u00A0It should look like this:[/b]\n<br />\n<br />[u]C:&#92;Program Files (x86)&#92;Steam&#92;steamapps&#92;common&#92;Stardew Valley&#92;Mods(Content Patcher, TMXL, HD Portraits, Anti-Social NPCs and Free Love inside)\n<br />[/u][/size]\n<br />༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶\n<br />\n<br />[size=4]\uD83C\uDF3B\u00A0How to install the\u00A0[u]portraits[/u]:[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=3]No need to do anything! Just download the\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/10971]HD Portraits[/url]\u00A0mod![/size]\n<br />\n<br />༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶༶•┈┈୨♡୧┈┈•༶",
